messages[15]{user,text}:
  user_2,[00:00] Hi Rohan it's Vikram Patel from Omni Insurance how are you
  user_1,[00:05] Hey Vikram uh I'm good thanks
  user_2,[00:10] Great just wanted to follow up on the updated policy PDF we sent yesterday did you get a chance to look at it
  user_1,[00:15] Yeah I opened it but I have a couple of questions
  user_2,[00:20] Sure fire away
  user_1,[00:22] First about the claim process for outpatient specialist visits what do I need to do
  user_2,[00:28] Okay so for any OPD specialist claim you log in to our portal fill the claim form upload the receipt and doctor prescription then we process within five to seven business days you can also email them to claims@omniinsurance.com if you prefer
  user_1,[00:35] Got it and do I need pre‑authorization for specialist visits
  user_2,[00:40] No pre‑auth needed for covered specialists as long as it’s within network just keep the documents
  user_1,[00:45] Alright also I was thinking of adding my spouse as a dependent is that possible now
  user_2,[00:50] You can add a spouse during open enrollment or anytime with a thirty day waiting period and underwriting it will affect the premium
  user_1,[00:55] Okay I’ll wait for open enrollment then thanks for the info
  user_2,[01:00] No problem anything else
  user_1,[01:02] No that's all appreciate your help
  user_2,[01:05] Happy to help have a good day